{"1236040": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Mahasona", "steam_appid": 1236040, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<strong>Mahasona</strong> is a Third-person, Multiplayer, Social Horror game. <strong>Developed by RAM studios</strong> and <strong>Publish by Appscurve Studios</strong>. Where you can team up with other players as a team of four kids to find a treasure that belongs to a Demon name Mahasona. You as a kid need to find artifacts to unlock the treasure. As Mahasona you have to stop the kids from finding the Treasure before sunrise. <i>The Sun Rising Finds the Treasure. Mahasona is hunting you!!!</i><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >How to play</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1236040/extras/a5fd43af3683ad6aaddd3806afa1a53b.poster.avif?t=1593116667\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1236040/extras/a5fd43af3683ad6aaddd3806afa1a53b.webm?t=1593116667\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1236040/extras/a5fd43af3683ad6aaddd3806afa1a53b.mp4?t=1593116667\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>This game uses Steam servers to make matches. So you and your 4 friends can host a match or you can find a match using the Server browser in-game. once you load into the match you have to select a Character. Once all 5 players choose a character and ready up the match will begin. Mahasona the demon will be randomly given to a player. The player who gets to play as Mahasona has to find 4 kids before they find your Treasure. Kids have to find artifacts to find the location of the Treasure. Each kid has a unique skill and a passive ability. Mahasona has <strong>Demon Vision</strong> which highlight kids withing a small radius This is how the game works.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Day Night</h2>Each match will start at 12:00 AM ingame time and ends at 6:00 AM ingame time. You can see the time on your HUD. the game also has a day-night cycle so you'll see the sunrise.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1236040/extras/7bb919f3c5fb0515400cb9ec45fad1b6.poster.avif?t=1593116667\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1236040/extras/7bb919f3c5fb0515400cb9ec45fad1b6.webm?t=1593116667\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1236040/extras/7bb919f3c5fb0515400cb9ec45fad1b6.mp4?t=1593116667\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>", "about_the_game": "<strong>Mahasona</strong> is a Third-person, Multiplayer, Social Horror game. <strong>Developed by RAM studios</strong> and <strong>Publish by Appscurve Studios</strong>. Where you can team up with other players as a team of four kids to find a treasure that belongs to a Demon name Mahasona. You as a kid need to find artifacts to unlock the treasure. As Mahasona you have to stop the kids from finding the Treasure before sunrise. <i>The Sun Rising Finds the Treasure. Mahasona is hunting you!!!</i><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >How to play</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1236040/extras/a5fd43af3683ad6aaddd3806afa1a53b.poster.avif?t=1593116667\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1236040/extras/a5fd43af3683ad6aaddd3806afa1a53b.webm?t=1593116667\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1236040/extras/a5fd43af3683ad6aaddd3806afa1a53b.mp4?t=1593116667\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><